  "body": "### Description\n\nFinal agent config has missing properties such as `model`.\n\neg an agent-test.md file with a bare `*` (`Unexpected scalar token` in YAMLLint)\n```\n---\ndescription: demo agent for testing config\nmode: subagent\nmodel: github-copilot/claude-sonnet-4.6\npermission:\n  task:\n    *: deny\n    build: allow\n---\n```\nis successfully consumed but results in\n```\n    \"agent-test\": {\n      \"prompt\": \"---\\ndescription: demo agent for testing config\\nmode: subagent\\nmodel: github-copilot/claude-sonnet-4.6\\npermission:\\n  task:\\n    *: deny\\n    build: allow\\n---\",\n      \"name\": \"agent-test\",\n      \"options\": {},\n      \"permission\": {}\n    },\n```\n\n### Plugins\n\n_No response_\n\n### OpenCode version\n\n1.2.27\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd this file to the opencode agents folder: [agent-test.md](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26073294/agent-test.md)\n\nrun `opencode debug config`\n\n### Screenshot and/or share link\n\n_No response_\n\n### Operating System\n\nmacOS Tahoe 26.3\n\n### Terminal\n\niTerm2",
